！#电商创业 #电商黑话 #抖店新手运营 #电商干货 #新手开网店 @抖音电商 @抖音创作小助手","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7601025024811748646","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7601025024811748646","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-079d5eb8afd54bdeb88be8b734c02a91:8","title":"电商人一定要搞懂的ROI公式。#电商运营 #电商干货 #投产比 #新手开网店","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-079d5eb8afd54bdeb88be8b734c02a91:9","title":"达人合作 ROI 计算器 — 免费 TikTok Shop 达人回报工具","raw_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","host":"www.chuhaijiang.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-079d5eb8afd54bdeb88be8b734c02a91:10","title":"真实ROI、引导GMV，直播带货都在聊的ROI水有多深?-36氪","raw_url":"https://www.36kr.com/p/822185997933704","normalized_url":"https://www.36kr.com/p/822185997933704","host":"www.36kr.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","question_text":"达人ROI计算公式是什么？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":11,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"40930e2ace6acc36ea9c87bbb2b91adcefcd10f4ac39e2c604330e63fa397e17","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人ROI（分2个常用口径，电商达人带货）\n> 很多人会把 **ROAS（成交额投产）** 口语叫ROI，正式ROI是**利润口径**\n\n## 1、商家日常最常用：达人ROAS（成交额投产，大家习惯叫达人ROI）\n**ROAS（俗称达人ROI）= 达人归因GMV ÷ 达人总投入成本**\n- 达人总投入成本 = 坑位费 + 样品费 + 达人佣金 + 给这条视频的投流费 + 其他服务费\n> 例：坑位费5000，样品1000，佣金合计4000，投流2000；达人带货GMV 36000\n> 总成本=5000+1000+4000+2000=12000\n> ROI(ROAS)=36000 ÷ 12000 = **3.0**\n\n## 2、标准财务ROI（利润口径，真实投资回报率）\n**ROI =（达人带来毛利 − 达人总投入成本）÷ 达人总投入成本 ×100%**\n- 毛利 = 归因GMV × 产品毛利率（记得扣退货）\n> 接上例，毛利率30%，毛利=36000×30%=10800\n> ROI=(10800−12000)÷12000 = -10% （这次合作亏损）\n\n## 📌 保本ROI（达人带货）\n**保本ROAS = 1 ÷ 毛利率**（简化版，不考虑退货、平台扣点）\n> 毛利率30% → 保本ROAS≈3.33，ROAS＞3.33才赚钱\n\n## ⚠️ 重要注意点\n1. **归因**：一定要用专属链接/优惠码/达人码，统计达人直接带来成交，包含7/15/30天转化窗口，区分直接成交和长尾种草成交\n2. **退货**：核算时建议GMV扣掉退货金额，否则虚高ROI\n3. **成本不要漏**：坑位费、样品、佣金、投流、平台服务费都要计入总成本\n\n需要我给你一个可直接复制到Excel的达人ROI核算模板吗？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-18cc6a76a74c4a89ab23b349e6cbd45f:1","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-18cc6a76a74c4a89ab23b349e6cbd45f:2","title":"达人合作 ROI 计算器 — 免费 TikTok Shop 达人回报工具","raw_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","host":"www.chuhaijiang.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-18cc6a76a74c4a89ab23b349e6cbd45f:3","title":"达人投放 ROI 测算✨投放人必存表格。做品牌投放的姐妹！不要再盲目砸💰找达人合作啦 一张表教你算清楚，达人报价到底值不值