赚回了多少钱**。  ### 最简单的算法 ROI = 销售额 ÷ 广告费 比如： - 花了1万投流","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7682194120518257893","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7682194120518257893","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-4b67cb1ff27a4f58a813c55ecefaf0ee:11","title":"达人合作 ROI 计算器 — 免费 TikTok Shop 达人回报工具","raw_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","host":"www.chuhaijiang.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-4b67cb1ff27a4f58a813c55ecefaf0ee:12","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8fcn?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=href","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8fcn?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=href","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","question_text":"达人ROI计算公式是什么？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":10,"valid_url_cards":10,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"a865d06812f9e1d5dda030c5497662b14d985a7d2b80e1ba07829006f4e37a0b","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅达人ROI（电商行业最常用2套公式）\n> 行业里分**GMV口径（销售投产，看带货规模）** 和**利润口径（真实投资回报率，看赚不赚钱）**\n\n## 1、GMV口径（商家复盘达人带货最常用，短视频/直播达人）\n**ROI = 达人归因成交GMV ÷ 达人合作总投入成本**\n- 达人总投入成本 = 坑位费 + 样品成本 + 给达人佣金 + 配套投流费用 + 服务费\n> 例：坑位费1万，样品0.2万，佣金合计0.8万；达人视频带来GMV6万\n> ROI = 6 ÷ (1+0.2+0.8)= **3:1**\n\n## 2、利润口径（真实ROI，判断本次达人合作是否盈利）\n**ROI =（归因GMV × 毛利率 - 达人总投入成本）÷ 达人总投入成本**\n> 结果＞0代表盈利；等于0刚好保本；小于0亏损\n\n## 补充：保本ROI（用来提前预估达人需要做到多少GMV才不亏）\n**保本ROI = 1 ÷ 毛利率**\n> 毛利率40%，保本ROI=1÷0.4=2.5，也就是达人GMV口径ROI至少做到2.5才回本\n\n## ⚠️重要注意点\n1. **归因**：一定要用专属链接/优惠码/UTM追踪，区分达人带来的成交，避免把自然流量算进去，拉高ROI虚高\n2. **退货**：复盘建议用**实际回款GMV（扣退货）**，不要用原始GMV，否则数据失真\n3. **两种ROI别混淆**\n    - GMV口径：对外汇报、达人筛选、横向对比达人；\n    - 利润口径：内部财务测算、判断项目盈亏。\n\n要不要我给你一个可直接复制到Excel的达人ROI计算表模板？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-2d586bb5b79e452e8094ae0d7096e0c1:1","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-2d586bb5b79e452e8094ae0d7096e0c1:2","title":"达人合作 ROI 计算器 — 免费 TikTok Shop 达人回报工具","raw_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://www.chuhaijiang.com/tools/creator-roi-calculator","host":"www.chuhaijiang.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0026","question_id":"CQ-Q0026","citation_id":"smp-2d586bb5b79e452e8094ae0d7096e0c1:3","title":"达人投放 ROI 测算✨投放人必存表格。做品牌投放的姐妹！不要再盲目砸💰找达人合作啦 一张表教你算清楚，达人报价到底值不值得冲✅  ▫️核心 ROI 计算公式 ROI = 投放带来总收益 ÷ 投放总成","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","acce